Speech_0294L=LAMBERT - The archives you looked at detailed account transactions from a man named Zherkezhi. He's a big time computational theorist... I hope he's not involved in this mess.
Speech_0150L=LAMBERT - Oh no... Zherkezhi... that's exactly what I didn't want to see...
Speech_0153L=FISHER - Zherkezhi... is that some kind of dried meat?
Speech_0154L=LAMBERT - He's probably the best computational theorist in the world... he worked with Morgenholt on Project Watson... word is he's gone off his nut...
Speech_0155L=FISHER - Sounds like bad-guy material to me...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0216L=LAMBERT - The archives you looked at detailed account transactions from a man named Zherkezhi. He's a big time computational theorist... I hope he's not involved in this mess.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0158L=LAMBERT - Oh no... Zherkezhi... that's exactly what I didn't want to see...
Speech_0159L=FISHER - Zherkezhi? Grimsdottir mentioned him in relation to this Dvorak...
Speech_0162L=LAMBERT - Well, whoever this Dvorak is, I pray he hasn't gotten hold of Zherkezhi.
Speech_0163L=FISHER - Why... who is he?
Speech_0164L=LAMBERT - He's probably the best computational theorist in the world... he worked with Morgenholt on Project Watson... word is he's gone off his nut...
Speech_0165L=FISHER - Sounds like bad-guy material to me...
