Speech_0174L=FISHER - I remember this place... there are some bricked up sections here that lead into the tunnels Noriega used to smuggle his drug money out of the country...
Speech_0175L=REDDING - The tunnels are probably still there... you know what to do...
Speech_0236L=REDDING - Fisher, see if you can find a weak spot to blast your way out of here.
Speech_0299L=LAMBERT - Good job Fisher, we just ID'd Lacerda's Panamanian contact.
Speech_0144L=LAMBERT - It looks like Lacerda's Panamanian contact is Senor Segundo Ruiz de Medeiros. Vice President of Panama Canal Administration.
Speech_0145L=FISHER - Is that where I'm going next?
Speech_0146L=LAMBERT - No... Lacerda's side dealings are a whole 'nother can of worms... I'll send someone else down that trail...
Speech_0147L=FISHER - Someone else?
Speech_0148L=LAMBERT - Do I detect a bit of jealousy Sam?
Speech_0149L=FISHER - I'll get over it...
