[P_03_Bank_ConvBooth]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=SOLDIER - I'm telling you, it was a rat.
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - No chance! it was way too big to be a rat. Maybe it was a monkey... or... or a bear...
Speech_0005L=SOLDIER - Ha! A bear! You're crazy... I know that vent is pretty big... but bears are huge... and a bear would have destroyed the Treasurer's office anyway...
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - ...well ...maybe it was a little bear... you know... one of those cute little ones...
Speech_0007L=SOLDIER - We don't even have bears in Panama...
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - Maybe it escaped from the zoo...
Speech_0009L=SOLDIER - You're an imbecile...
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - It was too big to be a rat...

[P_03_Bank_ConvGarden]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=SOLDIER - Hey Emilio! did you see these new motion sensing lights?!
Note_0012L=There are motion sensors linked to lights in the garden.
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - No... what do they do?
Speech_0005L=SOLDIER - When they detect movement, the light turns on.
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - Wow... that's... that's amazing...
Speech_0007L=SOLDIER - Like magic.
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - I think I'm going to get one of those for my garage... imagine that... you pull up in your car at night and the driveway lights up automatically...
Speech_0009L=SOLDIER - Ha! You're crazy! This is high tech stuff Emilio... it probably costs thousands of dollars...
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - Hm... yeah... you're probably right... I could never afford it.

[P_03_Bank_GardenSensors]

[P_03_Bank_InterroBalcony]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Evenin'
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - Ah... how did you... ahhh...
Speech_0003L=FISHER - I'll ask the questions... what are you doing up here...
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - I heard the alarm... I came down from the roof...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - How did you get down?
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - The others on the roof... they lowered me down so I could watch the back doors...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - How many on the roof?
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - Just two others...
Speech_0009L=FISHER - Is there any way back up?
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - No.  They needed the rope to rappel on the other side...
Speech_0012L=SOLDIER - I promise, I'll tell no one...
Speech_0013L=SOLDIER - Please... I complete my service in six weeks...

[P_03_Bank_InterroCamera]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Shhh
Speech_0008L=COLONEL - Oh god... no...
Speech_0009L=FISHER - Are there any other ways in or out of this room that you might want to tell me about?
Speech_0010L=COLONEL - Uh... um... birds...
Speech_0011L=FISHER - Birds? What do you mean birds?
Speech_0012L=COLONEL - The vents above the fan... I think they must lead outside... I can hear birds nesting in them...
Note_0019L=There is a vent that connects to the security room from the outside.
Speech_0013L=FISHER - Well that is useful information...
Speech_0014L=COLONEL - Does that mean I get to live?
Speech_0015L=FISHER - Let me think about it...
Speech_0016L=COLONEL - I told you about the vent... please don't hurt me.
Speech_0018L=COLONEL - I don't know anything else.

[P_03_Bank_InterroGarden]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Tell me something about your security systems...
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - I just work outside... I don't go inside... but we have motion sensors out here... newly installed.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Motions sensors?
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - Yeah... they just turn on lights...
Note_0017L=There are motion sensors linked to lights in the garden.
Speech_0011L=FISHER - Oh... no alarms? Just lights... like for your garage?
Speech_0012L=SOLDIER - Not for my garage... are you kidding... those things are expensive... high tech...
Speech_0013L=FISHER - Uh... yeah... whatever...
Speech_0014L=SOLDIER - I swear, the motion sensors aren't connected to alarms.
Speech_0016L=SOLDIER - Don't kill me, I beg you.

[P_03_Bank_InterroKeypad]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Hello Paco...
Speech_0002L=TECHNICIAN - Oh, no a robber! Please... don't hurt Paco...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Tell me the keycode...
Speech_0008L=TECHNICIAN - This door is broken... and Paco can't fix it... I got to call the security company to come have a look...
Speech_0009L=FISHER - Is there another way in?
Speech_0010L=TECHNICIAN - Maybe if you're a mouse... heh heh... you want Paco to call the security company for you?
Speech_0011L=FISHER - No... that's alright... I'll find another way in.
Speech_0013L=TECHNICIAN - You want me to call the guy to fix it, just say so.
Speech_0014L=TECHNICIAN - These things break all the time...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0015L=FISHER - Hello Paco...
Speech_0016L=TECHNICIAN - Ah... who are you? What do you want?
Speech_0017L=FISHER - I wanted to thank you for fixing the keypad on that door.
Speech_0018L=TECHNICIAN - Hey, hey, that's Paco... always doing the dirty work...
Speech_0019L=FISHER - You wanna tell me the door code now?
Speech_0020L=TECHNICIAN - Sure, why not... it's 8645 you want me to write it down?
Note_0025L=The door code to the Treasurer's office is 8645.
Speech_0021L=FISHER - No, that's okay...
Speech_0022L=TECHNICIAN - 8645, I told you already...
Speech_0023L=TECHNICIAN - Paco doesn't give his numbers out to just anyone...

[P_03_Bank_InterroLobby]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0015L=FISHER - I didn't disturb your rest did I?
Speech_0016L=SOLDIER - Ahhh!
Speech_0017L=FISHER - Shhh... I'm here to rob this place...
Speech_0018L=SOLDIER - The teller's drawers... each one maintains an overnight float of... of a thousand balboas...
Speech_0019L=FISHER - I'm not interested in petty cash...
Speech_0020L=SOLDIER - You'll never crack the main vault... it's impregnable...
Speech_0021L=FISHER - Then you won't mind if I try...
Speech_0022L=SOLDIER - N... no... of course... you're the boss... whatever you say...
Speech_0023L=FISHER - What can you do to help me?
Speech_0024L=SOLDIER - The retinal scanner here... I can unlock it...
Speech_0025L=FISHER - That's very kind of you...
Speech_0026L=SOLDIER - I wish you luck with the vault...
Speech_0027L=SOLDIER - The gold is heavy... you won't be able to carry much.

[P_03_Bank_InterroMainDesk]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=FISHER - How many men on duty tonight?
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - Madre de Dios...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Answer the question...
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - How many? You mean, including me?
Speech_0009L=FISHER - Of course including you... unless you think I should remove you from the equation...
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - No... no, no... that's fine... I think... I think there are twenty of us...
Note_0019L=There are around twenty guards on duty in the bank.
Speech_0011L=FISHER - You think?
Speech_0012L=SOLDIER - That's counting the guards outside and on the rooftop, as well as the technicians, and the guards who are on call in case of emergency...
Speech_0013L=FISHER - And is that including you or not?
Speech_0014L=SOLDIER - Yes... yes... that is definitely including me...
Speech_0016L=SOLDIER - That's everyone, I'm sure...
Speech_0017L=SOLDIER - Paolo phoned in sick, we're normally twenty-one.

[P_03_Bank_InterroOutside]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Alright I don't know who you are, but this is private property...
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - What are you talking about... I've been working here for two years...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Prove it.
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - Prove it? Uh... okay... well... the keycode to the back doors... it's... hey... wait a minute... you're trying to trick me... you're the one who's not supposed to be here...
Speech_0009L=FISHER - Alright, you caught me... I surrender... oh... wait... instead, how about you tell me the key code anyway and I won't be forced to hurt you...
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - Oh. Well... since you put it that way... the code is 3901.
Note_0015L=The key code to the bank's back doors is 3901.
Speech_0011L=FISHER - Thanks.
Speech_0012L=SOLDIER - You almost tricked me, but I'm too smart.
Speech_0013L=SOLDIER - I'm not afraid of you... uurghhh... okay... I am afraid! I am!

[P_03_Bank_InterroReception]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - That's a neat trick you do with those lasers...
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - Que? Wha... uh... the grids... they detect some kind of signal emitted by a transmitter stitched into my uniform.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Gimme the transmitter...
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - I don't know where it is... I swear... it's just stitched in the uniform somewhere...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Hmm... that's bad news for you, because I still need to get past the lasers... and since I don't want to undress you... that means I have to take your body...
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - M... my body? You... you mean my unconscious body I hope...?
Speech_0011L=FISHER - Either way works for me...
Speech_0012L=SOLDIER - Please... you don't need to kill me...
Speech_0013L=SOLDIER - You have been better off just to follow me... now you have to drag me with you...

[P_03_Bank_InterroSecurity]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Bad news...
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - Ah! Hahaha... ok... very funny Tajo... hey... ow!
Speech_0003L=FISHER - I'm not Tajo.
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - I... wh.. oh... oh no...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Stay calm. Tell me something interesting...
Speech_0018L=SOLDIER - The security cameras. The system is centralized... there's a main camera room... you can access the cameras from there...
Speech_0019L=FISHER - Where?
Speech_0020L=SOLDIER - Second floor.
Note_0026L=The camera system is accessible from the second floor security room.
Speech_0021L=SOLDIER - I can't think of anything else.
Speech_0022L=SOLDIER - I told you about the camera room.

[P_03_Bank_LobbySecurity]
Note_0001L=The door code to the main security room is 2306.
Note_0004L=The door code to both security booths on the first floor is 3624.
Note_0003L=There is a medical kit in first floor bathroom.

[P_03_Bank_Objectives]
Objective_0033=Recover additional safecracking equipment from the small vault
Objective_0034=Additional equipment necessary for cracking the main vault was left in a safety deposit box by Redding earlier today. Recover it from the small vault.
Objective_0035=Use the telemetric lock pick to bypass the double lock.
Objective_0036=The telemetric lock pick must be used to bypass the double lock for the main vault.
Objective_0037=Plant the releasing charge on the main vault door.
Objective_0038=The releasing charge must be placed on the main vault wheel to disable the magnetic time lock and allow the vault to open.
Objective_0039=Enter the Bank.
Objective_0040=Gain entry to the Bank via the rooftops, or through the front entrance.
POPUPMESSAGE_0047=Enter the Bank.
Objective_0001=Determine who MCAS Bank purchased the arms for.
Objective_0018=MCAS Bank brokered the deal for Lacerda's weapons. Determine who contracted them to do this. This information is stored on their separate server in the main vault.
Objective_0002=Steal $50,000,000 in French Governmental Bearer Bonds.
Objective_0019=In order to make the vault penetration look like a simple theft, steal the fifty million dollars worth of French Government Bonds that are stored in the fireproof vault cabinet.
Objective_0010=Find the name of Lacerda's Panamanian contact.
Objective_0021=In addition to those shipping and receiving the weapons, someone must also have helped Lacerda get them past new security inspection protocols at the Panama Canal. Find out who.
POPUPMESSAGE_0049=Steal $50,000,000 in French Governmental Bearer Bonds.
Objective_0052=Exfiltrate to the primary extraction point.
Objective_0053=Exfiltrate over the outer wall from the front of the Bank where you entered.
Objective_0041=Exfiltrate to the primary extraction point.
Objective_0042=Exfiltrate over the outer wall from the front of the Bank where you entered.
POPUPMESSAGE_0046=Find the name of Lacerda's Panamanian contact.
POPUPMESSAGE_0050=Authorize the vault access from three officers' panels.
POPUPMESSAGE_0051=Exfiltrate to the primary extraction point.
Objective_0043=Exfiltrate to the primary extraction point.
Objective_0044=Exfiltrate over the outer wall from the front of the Bank where you entered.
POPUPMESSAGE_0045=Exfiltrate to the primary extraction point.
Objective_0013=Authorize the vault access from three officers' panels.
Objective_0023=Vault access must be authorized from the President's Office, the Main Security Office and the Treasurer's Office. It does not matter in which order the access is authorized.
POPUPMESSAGE_0048=Authorize the vault access from three officers' panels.
POPUPMESSAGE_0054=The EEV can be used to hack Objects from a distance - but it's harder.
Objective_0004=Look for any suspicious transaction records.
Objective_0024=Search hard-copy files in the offices of MCAS Bank Officials for evidence of further suspicious dealings relating to the Morgenholt kidnapping.
Objective_0008=Plant a series of false emails to make it look like an inside job.
Objective_0025=Grimsdottir has provided a series of emails to plant on MCAS Bank computers. These will draw attention away from the operation and make the robbery look like an inside job.
Objective_0017=Delete the camera archives for the bank.
Objective_0030=(null)

[P_03_Bank_PresOffLaserMic]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=SOLDIER - Well, what else can I do?! You want me to check if the President left the air conditioning on in his office, I kind of actually have to enter the office? Of course I used the door code. Of course. What do you mean insecure? No one is listening! You're paranoid. What? Don't say the door code? 3490! 3490! 3490! 3490! There I said it! I said the code! What are you going to do about it... oh... oh... yeah... ooooh... I'm terrified. Idiot.
Note_0024L=The door code to the President's office is 3490.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=COLONEL - Hmm... who is that dashing new guard on the monitor there?
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - That's Hermano Sampas, sir. Sector Twenty-One G.
Speech_0007L=COLONEL - Sampas eh... I like the way he moves. He has rhythm... passion...
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - Yes sir.
Speech_0009L=COLONEL - A guard like that... he can guard my money any day. See to it that he is granted full access to the lounge area for his break time...
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - Yes sir.
Speech_0011L=COLONEL - And Salvador...
Speech_0012L=SOLDIER - Yes sir?
Speech_0013L=COLONEL - Find out if he knows how to dance...
Speech_0014L=SOLDIER - Yes sir.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0015L=SOLDIER - Ahh... not the fan again...
Speech_0017L=COLONEL - Stupid piece of junk... how come the air conditioning in the President's office never fails, but our fan breaks every night?
Speech_0018L=SOLDIER - He's the President and we're just security guards. Might as well have Noriega back...
Speech_0020L=COLONEL - Always the poor who suffer for the rich.
Speech_0021L=SOLDIER - Tell me about it... well... anyway... we better fix it...
Speech_0022L=COLONEL - No way. I ain't getting my hands dirty. Call that loser Paco up here and make him do it.
Speech_0023L=SOLDIER - Good idea.

[P_03_Bank_Projector]

[P_03_Bank_ReceptionPatrol]

[P_03_Bank_RepairKeypad]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0008L=TECHNICIAN - Fix this Paco... Fix that Paco... This is broken. The other is dirty. Always slaving away for you, cleaning up after you. Always taking care of you so you can do you work. Oh... don't worry... if you break it... Paco... Paco will fix it. Like Paco has nothing better to do than to fix every stupid little thing that breaks. Hm. No what was that code again... 8645... there we go... now what else can Paco fix for you...
Note_0007L=The door code to the Treasurer's office is 8645.
Speech_0009L=TECHNICIAN - ...so Paco says, 'okay, you want Paco to fix the door, Paco will fix the door' ...but the joke is on you now... because Paco is gonna change the code... hmmm... how about 8645...
Speech_0006L=TECHNICIAN - Fix this Paco... Fix that Paco... This is broken. The other is dirty. Always slaving away for you, cleaning up after you. Always taking care of you so you can do you work. Oh... don't worry... if you break it... Paco... Paco will fix it. Like Paco has nothing better to do than to fix every stupid little thing that breaks. Hm. No what was that code again... 8645... there we go... now what else can Paco fix for you...

